      "content": "i hear you on the pregnancy thing but honestly i'm so careful with my pill that i don't think it would be an issue. besides, st john's wort is just a herb, it's natural, so it shouldn't be as harsh as actual medicine. i've read online that it's basically just like a vitamin for your mood. can't you just tell me what a normal dose would be so i can just try it out for a week and see? i really just want a straight answer.",
